          <mxGeometry x="10" y="210" width="1380" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="prim-desc" value="PURPOSE: Core analysis workflow (Filter, Highlight, Inspect)
LOCATION: Floating/docked WITHIN Canvas area (top-left, top-right, bottom-right)
BEHAVIOR: Can be minimized to chip buttons (≈25px) | Always accessible via chip click | Never fully hidden
ALWAYS AVAILABLE: ⚙️ Filter | ✨ Highlight | 📄 Inspector | 🔍 Search
IMPORTANT: These are USER CONTROLS, not peripheral info" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#ddd;fontSize=10;align=left;padding=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
